## 1. Introduction and Scope

This Travel and Reimbursement Policy outlines guidelines for employees traveling on company business and procedures for reimbursing legitimate business expenses. The policy is designed to:

- Support business travel and customer engagement while managing costs responsibly
- Ensure fair and consistent treatment of all employees
- Maintain clear documentation and audit trails for compliance
- Prevent fraud and unauthorized expenses
- Comply with tax regulations and accounting standards

This policy applies to all employees of BrightPath Analytics who travel for business purposes or incur business expenses.

